      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "The last cycle may end midway through a pipe's turn.\n\nThat is normal. Once you know the remaining fraction, divide it by the current pipe's rate. Do not force the schedule to finish on an integer hour.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
